\par }{\insrsid3873829      }{\insrsid6044071   }{\insrsid2562360 The project graphical demonstrates }{\insrsid2380109 Data Structures}{\insrsid2562360 , which }{\insrsid2380109 will}{\insrsid2562360  help the students understand these algorithms }{
\insrsid2959380 easily.}{\insrsid13314328  As we know }{\insrsid2380109 to understand Data Structure it is }{\insrsid2562360 difficult when read from the}{\insrsid13314328  }{\insrsid2562360 textbook. The textbook}{\insrsid2380109  }{\insrsid2562360 
does not highlight up}{\insrsid13314328 on the points }{\insrsid6044071 
\par }{\insrsid13314328 of how the algori}{\insrsid2562360 thm actually functions. This project helps the students understand the actual}{\insrsid13314328  }{\insrsid2562360 working of }{\insrsid2380109 these Data Structures}{\insrsid2562360 
, which the textbook does not stress}{\insrsid13314328  }{\insrsid2562360 upon.
\par }{\insrsid7211412    }{\insrsid6044071  }{\insrsid7211412  \'93Almost all data processing activities demand data to be }{\insrsid6044071 processed}{\insrsid7211412  must be in some order}{\insrsid6044071 \'94. }{\insrsid7211412 
Sorting is a fundamental operation & one of the most frequently performed operation on Data Structure\rquote s. }{\insrsid6044071 Sometimes}{\insrsid7211412  decision making &}{\insrsid6044071  }{\insrsid7211412 
processing becomes very difficult if given set of data does not appear in some particular order.
\par \tab Sorting is the operation of arranging given data as records array elements, into
\par Some sequential order such as ascending order or descending there exits good number }{\insrsid6044071 
\par }\pard\plain \ql \li0\ri0\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0\pararsid3873829 \fs24\lang1033\langfe1033\cgrid\langnp1033\langfenp1033 {\insrsid7211412 of common sorting methods}{\insrsid8798672 
. One has to choose the best sorting technique subject to the individual circumstance of data processing & the order required that is relevant to h
e accumulated data. To choose between various sorting methods key considerations are efficiency considerations in terms of time}{\insrsid6044071  }{\insrsid8798672 (speed of operation & even memory}{\insrsid6044071  space required to arrange data.}{
\insrsid2380109 
\par }{\insrsid6044071         One of the field in a record serves to identify each and record distinctly. Such unique field associated with record is termed as }{\i\insrsid6044071\charrsid6044071 Key}{\i\insrsid6044071  }{\i\insrsid6044071\charrsid6044071 
field}{\i\insrsid6044071  }{\insrsid6044071 or simply }{\i\insrsid6044071\charrsid6044071 Key}{\i\insrsid6044071 , }{\insrsid6044071 or }{\i\insrsid6044071\charrsid6044071 Primary Key}{\insrsid6044071 
 K. Usually sorting operation will be performed based on a particular }{\i\insrsid6044071\charrsid6044071 Key value / Key field}{\insrsid6044071\charrsid6044071 
