\par }{\b\insrsid3873829        }{\b\insrsid2562360 Requirement Analysis}{\insrsid2562360  is the process }{\insrsid200901 of deriving}{\insrsid2562360 
 the system requirements through observation of the existing system, discussion with potential users and procurers, task  }{\insrsid200901 a}{\insrsid2959380 nalysis an}{\insrsid2562360 d so on. This may involve the development of one or more differ
ent system models. These help the analyst understand the system to be specified. System prototypes may be developed to help understand the requirements.
\par }{\insrsid6044071 
\par }{\insrsid2562360 We carried out the requirement analysis and found that our system should satisfy the 
