\par }{\insrsid4683581 As a platform-independent environment, Java can be bit slower than native code.}{\insrsid3815785 
\par }{\insrsid4683581 However, smart compiler, well-tuned}{\insrsid10563397  interpreters, and just-in-time byte code compilers can bring Java\rquote s performance close to that of native code without threatening compilers can bring Java\rquote 
s performance close to that of native code without threatening portability.}{\insrsid4683581 
