\par }{\insrsid3815785 
\par }{\insrsid10563397 A few essential detail of JAVA which }{\insrsid2047640 is}{\insrsid10563397  used by our application are described next.
\par 
\par }{\b\fs28\insrsid10563397\charrsid10238224 T}{\b\i\fs28\insrsid10563397\charrsid7371392 hreads
\par }{\b\insrsid10563397 
\par }{\insrsid10563397 A thread \lquote sometimes called an }{\i\insrsid10563397\charrsid10563397 execution context}{\insrsid10563397  or a }{\i\insrsid10563397\charrsid10563397 lightweight process}{\insrsid10563397 \rquote 
 is a single sequential flow of control within a program. You use threads to isolate tasks. Each thread is a sequential flow of control within the same program (the browser).}{\insrsid153849  A 
thread is similar to a sequential program. A single thread also}{\insrsid13914329 
 has a beginning, a sequence, and an end and at  any given time during the run of the thread, there is a single point of execution. However, a thread itself is not a program; it cannot run on its own. Rather, it runs within a program.}{\insrsid10563397 

