\par }\pard \ql \li0\ri0\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0\pararsid6779364 {\insrsid16006779 A softwa}{\insrsid16128728 
re design process is very complicated one. A general of software design is the form of a directed graph. The target design process is the creation of such a graph without inconsistencies. Software designer do not arrive at a finished design graph immediat
ely but the design has to be developed iteratively through a number of different versions. The design process involves formality and detail to the design as it is dev}{\insrsid15282082 
eloped with constant backtracking to correct earlier less formal design.
\par 
\par For our project we tried and }{\insrsid5046575 evaluated many design and finally came up with the one, which is described below.
\par 
\par We started with the idea that since it is for the user\rquote s understanding that we are going to developed this project we should make it as interactive as possible. We therefore provided the user a choice of the algorithm that he wants to animate.}{
\insrsid7362631  In addition to this we also provide}{\insrsid8550546 d a }{\insrsid14429192 buttons}{\insrsid8550546  to enter the }{\insrsid14429192 in a particular Algorithm}{\insrsid8550546 . When the }{\insrsid14429192 user presses}{\insrsid8550546  
}{\insrsid14429192 the button, a new window will be }{\insrsid8550546 display}{\insrsid14429192 ed}{\insrsid8550546  on screen}{\insrsid14429192  according to the user\rquote s choice}{\insrsid8550546 .
\par 
