\par }\pard \ql \li0\ri0\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0\pararsid6779364 {\fs28\ul\insrsid16675059 
\par }{\insrsid16675059 The project has been implemented using Java\rquote s capability to produce stand-alone animated applications. We created }{\insrsid14631803 a starting window}{\insrsid16675059  using the }{\b\insrsid16675059 Frame class }{
\insrsid14631803 to create a top level window. This window consisted of a Text box which is implemented using the }{\b\insrsid14631803 Textfield object.}{\insrsid14631803 
 This text box allows the user to enter the numbers that were animated. We provided a button to take the user to another window where the actual animation takes place.
\par 
\par The }{\insrsid352680 nodes are represented by circle. These circles are kept within another rectangle which simulates the binary tree. The actual animation is the moving the nodes represented by circles using the concept of }{\b\insrsid352680 threads.}{
\insrsid10973265  }{\insrsid941647 An}{\insrsid10973265  undo button is also present which takes allows the user to undo the recent operation he had done.}{\insrsid16188409 
